       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-MIXED-PRECISION.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MIXED-PRECISION-PROOFS.
           05  WS-FP16-BF16-EXP-ALIGN-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-LOSS-SCALE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KINETIC-DYNAMO-TORQUE-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNDERFLOW-GRAD-SAFE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NUMERICAL-EQUIV-FP32     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-MIXED-PREC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-MIXED-PREC-PROVEN    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-MIXED-PREC-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EXPONENT-AND-LOSS-SCALE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DYNAMO-AND-UNDERFLOW.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-MIXED-PRECISION.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EXPONENT-AND-LOSS-SCALE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FP16-BF16-EXP-ALIGN-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-LOSS-SCALE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DYNAMO-AND-UNDERFLOW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KINETIC-DYNAMO-TORQUE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNDERFLOW-GRAD-SAFE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NUMERICAL-EQUIV-FP32.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-MIXED-PRECISION.
           IF WS-FP16-BF16-EXP-ALIGN-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DYNAMIC-LOSS-SCALE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KINETIC-DYNAMO-TORQUE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-UNDERFLOW-GRAD-SAFE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-NUMERICAL-EQUIV-FP32 = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-MIXED-PREC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-MIXED-PREC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-MIXED-PREC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-MIXED-PREC-CODE.
